# StackMap Android - Fastlane Environment Variables Template
# DO NOT COMMIT THIS FILE WITH ACTUAL CREDENTIALS
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your credentials

# ========================================
# CREDENTIAL SECURITY - RECOMMENDED APPROACH
# ========================================
# For maximum security, store credentials in macOS Keychain instead of this file.
# Run: fastlane store_credentials_in_keychain
# This will securely store your Google Play JSON key path in the system Keychain.

# ========================================
# GOOGLE PLAY CONSOLE SERVICE ACCOUNT
# ========================================
# Path to JSON key file from Google Play Console
# RECOMMENDED: Store in Keychain using: fastlane store_credentials_in_keychain
# ALTERNATIVE: Set environment variable below (less secure)
# PLAY_STORE_JSON_KEY_PATH="/Users/YOUR_USERNAME/.android/stackmap-play-store-key.json"

# ========================================
# ANDROID KEYSTORE CREDENTIALS
# ========================================
# These should match the values in your shell profile (~/.zshrc or ~/.bashrc)
# STACKMAP_STORE_PASSWORD="your-keystore-password-here"
# STACKMAP_KEY_PASSWORD="your-key-password-here"

# ========================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS
# ========================================
# 1. Copy this file to .env:
#    cp .env.default .env
#
# 2. OPTION A - Keychain (RECOMMENDED):
#    fastlane store_credentials_in_keychain
#    (This will prompt for your Google Play JSON key path)
#
# 3. OPTION B - Environment Variables (Less Secure):
#    Uncomment and fill in PLAY_STORE_JSON_KEY_PATH above
#
# 4. Set keystore passwords (choose one):
#    - Add to ~/.zshrc (recommended for local development)
#    - Uncomment and fill in this file (less secure)
#
# 5. Verify setup:
#    fastlane validate_signing

# ========================================
# TODO: OBTAIN GOOGLE PLAY CREDENTIALS
# ========================================
# Before running fastlane beta deployment, you need to:
# 1. Create a Google Cloud service account
# 2. Download the JSON key file
# 3. Grant the service account access in Google Play Console
# 4. Store the JSON key securely
#
# See docs/FASTLANE_SETUP_ANDROID.md for detailed instructions
